data: {"id": "2c56c457d1614039-thinking-parallel_evidence-1554", "run_id": "2c56c457d1614039", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 证据结论\n\n## 实体身份\n- **Pod**: `workload` (`aiops-case-v05`)\n- **UID**: `b9e687f5-702b-4d01-bfb9-2df4ff23ba91`\n- **Node**: `node2`\n- **状态**: `Pending` / `ContainerCreating` (Waiting)\n\n## 支持候选原因的事实\n1. **Events 明确指向 ConfigMap 键缺失**:\n   - `Warning FailedMount 69s (x17 over 19m) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`\n   - 该事件持续出现 19 分钟，频率高 (x17)，表明 kubelet 在尝试挂载卷 `input` 时失败。\n2. **Pod YAML 卷配置验证**:\n   - Pod 定义中包含一个卷 `input`，类型", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789122951485, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

