data: {"id": "2c56c457d1614039-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "2c56c457d1614039", "seq": 1557, "ts_ms": 1789122968257, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.275, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1796, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`：configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key | 确证 Volume 'input' 挂载因配置引用错误直接失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`：timed out waiting for the condition | 描述因挂载失败导致的超时现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition`：`ContainersReady: False`, `Ready: False` | 确证 Pod 整体不可用且容器未就绪 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`：`ContainerCreating` | 确证容器处于等待启动状态，未进入运行期 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory`：`32Mi` | 提供内存上下文，排除因硬限制导致 OOM 的可能（当前容器甚至未启动） |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`：`ContainerCreating` (sample_count=1) | 从监控层面确认 Pod 处于 ContainerCreating 等待态 |\n| 7 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`：`0` | 确证容器从未成功启动，排除了因启动后崩溃重启导致的故障循环 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#1, #2）提供了明确的失败原因（ConfigMap key 缺失）和后果（MountVolume 失败/超时）。Kubernetes 状态（#3, #4）与 Metric（#6）相互印证了 Pod 停留在 `ContainerCreating` 且未就绪的现象。Metric（#7）的零重启次数证实了故障发生在容器启动之前的挂载阶段。K8s 配置（#5）表明当前资源限制并非导致挂载失败的直接原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 中缺少键 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 尝试挂载 Volume 'input' 时验证配置失败 → MountVolume.SetUp 失败且 Pod 持续超时等待 → Pod 状态保持为 Pending/ContainerCreating，用户不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **Pod 定义的 Volume 'input' 错误引用了 ConfigMap 'workload-input' 中不存在的 Key 'unavailable-key'**（见证据 #1）。这一配置错误导致 kubelet 无法完成卷挂载（MountVolume.SetUp failed），进而使得容器 `app` 无法进入运行状态，一直卡在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段（见证据 #3, #4, #6）。由于故障发生在容器启动之前，因此没有观察到任何容器重启或应用层日志。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`：configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key | 确证 Volume 'input' 挂载因配置引用错误直接失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`：timed out waiting for the condition | 描述因挂载失败导致的超时现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition`：`ContainersReady: False`, `Ready: False` | 确证 Pod 整体不可用且容器未就绪 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`：`ContainerCreating` | 确证容器处于等待启动状态，未进入运行期 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory`：`32Mi` | 提供内存上下文，排除因硬限制导致 OOM 的可能（当前容器甚至未启动） |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`：`ContainerCreating` (sample_count=1) | 从监控层面确认 Pod 处于 ContainerCreating 等待态 |\n| 7 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`：`0` | 确证容器从未成功启动，排除了因启动后崩溃重启导致的故障循环 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#1, #2）提供了明确的失败原因（ConfigMap key 缺失）和后果（MountVolume 失败/超时）。Kubernetes 状态（#3, #4）与 Metric（#6）相互印证了 Pod 停留在 `ContainerCreating` 且未就绪的现象。Metric（#7）的零重启次数证实了故障发生在容器启动之前的挂载阶段。K8s 配置（#5）表明当前资源限制并非导致挂载失败的直接原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 中缺少键 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 尝试挂载 Volume 'input' 时验证配置失败 → MountVolume.SetUp 失败且 Pod 持续超时等待 → Pod 状态保持为 Pending/ContainerCreating，用户不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **Pod 定义的 Volume 'input' 错误引用了 ConfigMap 'workload-input' 中不存在的 Key 'unavailable-key'**（见证据 #1）。这一配置错误导致 kubelet 无法完成卷挂载（MountVolume.SetUp failed），进而使得容器 `app` 无法进入运行状态，一直卡在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段（见证据 #3, #4, #6）。由于故障发生在容器启动之前，因此没有观察到任何容器重启或应用层日志。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "2c56c457d1614039-final", "run_id": "2c56c457d1614039", "seq": 1559, "ts_ms": 1789122968268, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`：configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key | 确证 Volume 'input' 挂载因配置引用错误直接失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`：timed out waiting for the condition | 描述因挂载失败导致的超时现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition`：`ContainersReady: False`, `Ready: False` | 确证 Pod 整体不可用且容器未就绪 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`：`ContainerCreating` | 确证容器处于等待启动状态，未进入运行期 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory`：`32Mi` | 提供内存上下文，排除因硬限制导致 OOM 的可能（当前容器甚至未启动） |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`：`ContainerCreating` (sample_count=1) | 从监控层面确认 Pod 处于 ContainerCreating 等待态 |\n| 7 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`：`0` | 确证容器从未成功启动，排除了因启动后崩溃重启导致的故障循环 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#1, #2）提供了明确的失败原因（ConfigMap key 缺失）和后果（MountVolume 失败/超时）。Kubernetes 状态（#3, #4）与 Metric（#6）相互印证了 Pod 停留在 `ContainerCreating` 且未就绪的现象。Metric（#7）的零重启次数证实了故障发生在容器启动之前的挂载阶段。K8s 配置（#5）表明当前资源限制并非导致挂载失败的直接原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 中缺少键 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 尝试挂载 Volume 'input' 时验证配置失败 → MountVolume.SetUp 失败且 Pod 持续超时等待 → Pod 状态保持为 Pending/ContainerCreating，用户不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **Pod 定义的 Volume 'input' 错误引用了 ConfigMap 'workload-input' 中不存在的 Key 'unavailable-key'**（见证据 #1）。这一配置错误导致 kubelet 无法完成卷挂载（MountVolume.SetUp failed），进而使得容器 `app` 无法进入运行状态，一直卡在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段（见证据 #3, #4, #6）。由于故障发生在容器启动之前，因此没有观察到任何容器重启或应用层日志。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 35.8s (Evidence 28.3s, RCA 7.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 64.237, "metrics": {"run_id": "2c56c457d1614039", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 64.24199652671814, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 64241.99652671814, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 61106.92834854126, "tool_calls": 8, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 8, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7208.925724029541, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2804.6255111694336}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19150.33769607544, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 35795.923709869385, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9275.450706481934, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

